  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Somalia: Advancing Somalia&apos;s Migration Governance with a Focus on Return and Reintegration</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">1) To enhance Somalia&#x2019;s migration governance and coordination structures through the effective operationalization of the National Coordination Mechanism on Migration (NCM). 2) To ensure that Somalia&#x2019;s legal and policy framework enables coherent, rights-based, and sustainable migration governance, with dedicated provisions for return and reintegration.</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="3">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Direct beneficiaries: Federal Government of Somalia, sub-national authorities working with migrants, vulnerable migrants, and returnees.Indirect beneficiaries: Migrants, vulnerable migrants, and returnees.</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project aims to strengthen the capacities of Somalia to better manage migration, with a focus on return and reintegration.</narrative>
  </description>
